From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 17:35:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mwifiex: match mainline 6.12.103 set_monitor_channel
 signature

The moal driver gates the struct net_device *dev parameter of
set_monitor_channel on CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= 6.13.0 (the argument was
added to cfg80211_ops.set_monitor_channel in the 6.13 merge window).

OpenWrt builds this driver against its mac80211 backports package (a ~6.18-era
cfg80211 retrofitted onto the kernel), so CFG80211_VERSION_CODE reports >= 6.13
and the guard resolves correctly. Armbian builds against the kernel's own
in-kernel cfg80211 - stock mainline stable 6.12.103 - which reports 6.12.103 but
has already backported this one 6.13 API (v6.12.103 include/net/cfg80211.h
declares set_monitor_channel with the net_device parameter). The guard selects
the old two-argument form and the cfg80211_ops assignment fails with
-Wincompatible-pointer-types.

set_monitor_channel is the only 6.13-guarded cfg80211 op that 6.12.103
backported (a full build of mlan+moal against 6.12.103 headers produces this
single error and nothing else). Lower the guard to 6.12.103 at the forward
declaration and the definition. The added dev parameter is unused by the body,
so no further change is needed; >= 6.12.103 stays correct for newer 6.12.y and
6.13+ kernels too.

Signed-off-by: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
---
 mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c b/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
index 21092c2..e6069b2 100644
--- a/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
+++ b/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
@@ -127,7 +127,7 @@ rmp_table_t rmp_table_sta_6G[] = {
 #ifdef UAP_SUPPORT
 #if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(3, 8, 0)
 static int woal_cfg80211_set_monitor_channel(struct wiphy *wiphy,
-#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 13, 0)
+#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 12, 103)
 					     struct net_device *dev,
 #endif
 					     struct cfg80211_chan_def *chandef);
@@ -699,7 +699,7 @@ static const struct wiphy_coalesce_support coalesce_support = {
 #ifdef UAP_SUPPORT
 #if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(3, 8, 0)
 static int woal_cfg80211_set_monitor_channel(struct wiphy *wiphy,
-#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 13, 0)
+#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 12, 103)
 					     struct net_device *dev,
 #endif
 					     struct cfg80211_chan_def *chandef)
-- 
2.47.3

